{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"bbbfeabdba7892a434801461abeb5240e1d929d2c6b42edd982b5334c51398bd","ja":"思い出の味","zh":"回忆中的味道","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"35e50f110405e3b064f80eb7a6a804367cdd5267ea7ada2437a891652f7c7649","ja":"やはり難しいですね……。","zh":"果然很难呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"87caa9976c4a648f761bacaba52bab6487726b9da895a3643974d5e33cd0878a","ja":"はい、しばらくはスケジュールを合わせられそうにない\nです。……お仕事がいっぱいなのは嬉しいのですが。","zh":"是的，暂时看来很难配合得上日程\n呢。……虽然工作满满当当让人很开心就是了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"12a40e689671ae376c13767be81e0f0a141cc0646d600e9ebfa31235c6819154","ja":"おはようございます……って、ふたりとも\nどうしたの？　困った顔して。","zh":"早上好……话说，你们两个\n怎么了？一脸为难的样子。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"810f9bd361514b591c11d7705a3a39c63d97c662f245df06ffe4138ae615e638","ja":"実は、このみが映画のろけ地で食べた鍋を\nもう一度、食べたいと言っていたのです。","zh":"其实，木实说想再吃一次\n在电影外景地吃过的锅物。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"022a1dd960374188d3e3588a24c6eeec63794acfe54957ca0d6a2f2674746782","ja":"それなら皆で食べに行こうと思ったのですが、\nすけじゅーるが合う日がなく……。","zh":"既然这样，本来是想大家一起去吃的，\n但日程一直对不上……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7a6cb4819099cbf1ae3afac179f292267c681d8db67c9d9dd756ba611251623e","ja":"なんだ。それなら、\nここで作っちゃえばいいじゃない。","zh":"什么嘛。既然这样，\n在这里做不就好了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"49a38735bea88bd0141c3627ac498dbbc17392b9da9c671af7c063ef497c58d8","ja":"はっ、確かにそれならできそうです。\n……全然気づかなかったぞ。","zh":"啊，确实如果是那样的话，好像就能做到了。\n……之前完全没注意到呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"043c12842fbdcd4131b5e75b0cabc30a6b595ce541ea9fd13b4f993930bd8af2","ja":"さすがは桃子。そうと決まれば、\nさっそくお鍋の用意をいたしましょう。","zh":"真不愧是桃子。既然已经决定了，\n那就赶紧准备火锅吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"84356aea21a17f83935d83a954ec3605d763287b23678b4a60a20906a8a98cf3","ja":"お鍋の具材はだいたい覚えています。ですが、\nお出汁は自信ありません……何が入っていたかな？","zh":"火锅里的食材我大致都记得。但是，\n高汤就没什么自信了……里面都放了些什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"cd783922c87fe894639b282e0e633c186a3a1dfa9f437c72aefea95609dcfe7c","ja":"たしか、お味噌が入ってたよね？\r\n他にもなにかあったと思うけど……。","zh":"我记得好像放了味噌吧？\n感觉应该还有别的什么才对……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"3ec069a0d50799a7c526e8550284de812ee2972dab4561b811c564ce2549d37a","ja":"はい。あの風味とまろやかさ……いったい、\nどのような隠し味が入っていたのでしょう……。","zh":"是的。那股风味和醇厚感……到底\n是加了什么样的独门秘料呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1308.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"507c8e91baa4eb58610f770525d208fb72b925308388f282e6580d32ea43d05d","ja":"難問ですが、これもこのみのため。\n必ずやこの謎を解き、お鍋の再現をしてみせましょう！","zh":"虽说是难题，但这全是为了木实。\n我定会解开这个谜题，把那锅火锅还原出来的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
